// The declaration of the surface a page is written against for the statechart
// {{ machine }} (docs/adr/0117, D7), beside the module it declares. A page in
// TypeScript that raises an event the machine does not take, or data its
// payload does not hold, does not compile.
//
// A value is in its wire form, the one its payload schema states (docs/adr/0086,
// section 3.1): a 64-bit integer is the text of its digits, a byte string a text
// of one character for each byte, and a value that may be absent is null when it
// is.

